            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.26.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Paulo amenye yuk’ umuce umwe ar’uw’ Abasadukayo, uwundi ar’uw’ Abafarisayo, ashira ijwi hejuru mu banyekombe, ati Bagabo bene Data, nd’ Umufarisayo, nd’ umwana w’Abafarisayo: ivy’ ivyizigiro vy’ibizoba n’ukuzuka kw’abapfuye ni vyo bimpagaritse mur’ izi manza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avuze artyo, havyuka ibihāri mu Bafarisayo n’Abasadukayo, abanyarukinja birema ibice. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.22.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 22:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukw Abasadukayo bāhakana yukw ata kuzuka kuriho, cank’ umumarayika n’impwemu; arikw Abafarisayo bāvyemera vyompi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.25.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyak 25:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.5.39"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "5:39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habah’ urwamo rwinshi; bamwe mu banyabgenge b’ivyanditswe bo mu muce w’Abafarisayo bava hasi barahārīra, bati Nta kibi twabonye kur’ uyu muntu. Kumbure impwemu cank’ umumarayika yoba yavuganye na we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habah’ ibihāri vyinshi, umukuru w’abagabisha b’abasoda atinye ko bogabangana Paulo, abarira ingabo ngo zimanuke zimubashikure, zimujane mw iboma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
