              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ijoro ry’uwo musi, Umwami Yesu amuhagarara hejuru, ati Hūmura; nk’uko wanshingiye intahe i Yerusalemu, ni k’ukwiye kuzonshingira intahe i Roma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iryo joro rikeye, Abayuda barakorana, barahira bīsiba yuko batazorya ntibanywe batarica Paulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abāhize bartyo bāsāga mirongwine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.16.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 16:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.16.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baja ku baherezi bakuru n’abakuru, bati Twarahiye twisivye bikomeye yukw ata co tuzotamira tutarica Paulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko rero mwebge n’abanyekombe, ni mubgire umukuru w’abagabisha b’abasoda amubamanukanire, nk’abarondera kurushiriza gutahura ivyiwe neza. Natwe, atarabashikīra, twiteguye kumwica.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwishwa wa Paulo yumva uwo mutego, araza ashika mw iboma, abibarira Paulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo ahamagara umwe mu bagabisha b’abasoda ijana, ati Jana uyu muhungu ku mukuru w’abagabisha b’abasoda; afise ijambo amubarira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na we aramujana amushīra uwo mukuru w’abagabisha, ati Ya mbohe Paulo yampamagaye aranyinginga, ngo nkuzanire uyu muhungu, afise ic’ akubarira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo mukuru amufata ukuboko, aramwikebanya aramubaza biherereye, at’ Ic’ ufise kumbarira n’iki? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aramwishura, at’ Abayuda bahūje inama yo kukwinginga ngw ejo uz’ umanukane Paulo mw ikombe, nk’ūgomba kubaza ivyiwe ng’ urushirize kubimenya neza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None rero ntuje kubumvira, kukw abantu babo basāga mirongwine bamuryamiye, barahiye bīsivye ko batazorya ntibanywe bataramwica; kandi none bariteguye, barorereye ic’ uribubemerere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo mukuru arungika uwo muhungu, amaze kumwihanikiriza, ati Ntugire umuntu ubarira yuk’ ummenyesheje ivyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
